Syntax and Markdown dependencies

The grammar data comes from @wooorm/starry-night 3.11.0. Its original NOTICE
and LICENSE accompany this file. Entries referring to lang/<name>.js map to
grammars/<name>.json in RayDE; names/extensions move into index.json and the
remaining TextMate grammar is serialized as JSON.

Irosashi 0.3.0 supplies the TextMate engine, with Ferroni 1.10.0 providing its
regex implementation. RayDE disables Irosashi's embedded grammar/theme data
and supplies the Linguist-derived bundle above.

Pulldown-cmark 0.13.4 parses Markdown. Mermaid-rs-renderer 0.3.1 renders diagrams.
LaTeX-Rust 3.0.1 renders mathematical LaTeX, including its STIX Two Math font and
dvips color data. Their respective notices and license texts are included here.
Exact transitive dependency versions are locked in native/rayscript/Cargo.lock.

Scraper 0.27.0 and html5ever 0.39.0 parse embedded HTML into document data.
The html-* files include their newly introduced dependency licenses. Selectors
is unmodified MPL-2.0 code; its SOURCE notice points to the exact source archive.
